zΔ⚡b|=4632|-1|+Un|=1|-1|+fi|=2e|-2|=1|+iff|=3|+<ref>{{Cite web%7Curl%3Dhttps://www.gnu.org/software/diffutils/manual/html_node/Detailed%2DUnified.html%7Ctitle%3DDetailed Description of Unified Format%7Cwebsite%3DGNU Diffutils (version 3.7, 7 January 2018)%7Caccess%2Ddate%3D29 January 2020%7Carchive%2Ddate%3D18 January 2020%7Carchive%2Durl%3Dhttps://web.archive.org/web/20200118142136/http://www.gnu.org/software/diffutils/manual/html_node/Detailed%2DUnified.html%7Curl%2Dstatus%3Dlive}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web%7Curl%3Dhttps://www.artima.com/weblogs/viewpost.jsp?thread%3D164293%7Ctitle%3DUnified Diff Format%7Clast%3Dvan Rossum%7Cfirst%3DGuido%7Cwebsite%3DAll Things Pythonic%7Caccess%2Ddate%3D2020%2D01%2D29%7Carchive%2Ddate%3D2019%2D12%2D25%7Carchive%2Durl%3Dhttps://web.archive.org/web/20191225234517/https://www.artima.com/weblogs/viewpost.jsp?thread%3D164293%7Curl%2Dstatus%3Dlive}}</ref>|=d1|+[[|=13|+]]|=2c|+[[|=6|+(Unix)%7Cpatch]] |=14f|+[[|=10|+]]|=23|+[[GNU%7C|=b|+]]|=e7|+[[Header (computing)%7C|=6|+]]|=46|-2|+<samp>%2D%2D%2D</samp>|=23|-2|+<samp>%2B%2B%2B</samp>|=c8|+[[|=9|+]]|=27|+[[|=a|+]]|=c9|+[[|=7|+]]|=54|+[[#Context format%7C|=5|+]]|=53|-1|+on|=6|+ti|=2|-1|=505|+[[|=a|-1|+pr|=1|-1|+s|=4|+]]|=a|+<ref>[https://www.gnu.org/software/diffutils/manual/html_node/Sections.html 2.2.3 Showing Which Sections Differences Are in], GNU diffutils manual</ref>|=bf|+<ref>[http://www.artima.com/weblogs/viewpost.jsp?thread%3D164293|=1|+Un|=2|+ied Diff Format] by [[Guido van Rossum]], June 14, 2006</ref> An|=4b|-2|+n|=18|-2|+n|=14|-5|=7|+diff |=52|-9|=2|-3|=3f|+1|=1|+3|=2|+1|=1|+9|=ad|+ %2D8,13 %2B14,8|=115|-5|+%2D22,3 %2B23,7 @|=44ed|
