zΔ⚡b|=3e|+%0A{{About%7Cthe command with Unix heritage%7Cthe general topic of file comparison%7CFile comparison%7Cdiffs in Wikipedia%7C:Help:Diff%7Cother uses%7CDIFF (disambiguation){{!}}DIFF}}%0A{{Lowercase title%7Ctitle%3Ddiff}}%0A|=1c|-6|=2|-4|+ff|=b|-6|=2|-4|+ff|=11|+!|=93|+ |=28|-2|=1|-1|+p|=1|+n|=10|-c|+%7C|=1|-1|+p|=1|+n|=e|-9|=8e|+!%2D%2D|=24|+yes/|=24|-1|+C|=18|-1|+C|=29|-2|=1f|-1|+V|=82|-1|+c|=1|+mputi|=1|-3|+g|=22|+M|=1|-3|+T|=33|-1|+<code>'''d|=3|-1|+'''</code>|=13a|+d|=3|-1|=47|+d|=3|-1|=6a|+ |=10|+ |=11f9|+%0A|=2|+ |=5|+ |=1|-3|+ |=21|+%0A|=2|+ |=6|+ |=1|+ |=a|+%0A|=2|+ |=4|+ |=1|+ |=10|+%0A|=2|+ |=9|+ |=1|-3|+ net|=8|+%0A|=2|+ |=a|+ |=1|-3|+ |=1|+457|=d|+%0A|=2|+ |=3|+ |=1|+ |=8|+grou|=1|-2|=1|+.go|=1|-2|+g|=1|+e|=2f|+%0A|=2|+ |=b|+ |=1|+ |=c|+%0A|=2|+ |=c|+ |=1|+ |=11|+%0A|=2|+ |=b|+ |=1|+ |=c|-3|=1|+rchive|=5c|+%0A|=2|+ |=a|+ |=1|+ |=4|+%0A |=4e3|-1|+di|=2|-1|=1|-8|+SUS|=802d|
